<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S5.SS2.SSS3" title="In 5.2 Baselines ‣ 5 Experiment ‣ Bridging Vision Language Models and Symbolic Grounding for Video Question Answering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.2.3 </span>Grounding-based or Retrieval-Augmented QA</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS3" title="In 5 Experiment ‣ Bridging Vision Language Models and Symbolic Grounding for Video Question Answering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.3 </span>Implementation Details</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS3.SSS0.Px1" title="In 5.3 Implementation Details ‣ 5 Experiment ‣ Bridging Vision Language Models and Symbolic Grounding for Video Question Answering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Scene Graph Variants</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS4" title="In 5 Experiment ‣ Bridging Vision Language Models and Symbolic Grounding for Video Question Answering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.4 </span>Main Results</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS5" title="In 5 Experiment ‣ Bridging Vision Language Models and Symbolic Grounding for Video Question Answering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.5 </span>Ablation on SG Variants</span></a></li>
